Error [jet.LiteralOutsideRange]: `13` is outside `Severity`'s range 0..10
  --> tests/ui/language_features/range_type_literal_proofs_cover_every_numeric_source_family.jet:7:37
    |
  7 |     narrow_float: Severity.from_f32(13.0)
    |                                     ^^^^
 Why: A range type only holds values inside its bounds; `13` can never be a `Severity`
 Fix: Use a value in `0..10`, or widen the type's range
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0135

Error [jet.RangeValueWithoutCheck]: Making a `Severity` from a runtime value can fail
  --> tests/ui/language_features/range_type_literal_proofs_cover_every_numeric_source_family.jet:7:37
    |
  7 |     narrow_float: Severity.from_f32(13.0)
    |                                     ^^^^
 Why: Only a literal is checked at compile time; a runtime number needs the fallible form so a bad value is handled
 Fix: Write `Severity.from_f32(raw)?` and handle the failure
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0136

